    "note": "Class levels are permanent designations. Graveyard Sneak grants and cast permissions are distinct; native costs remain choices. Additional costs compose in either order with the return, using actual post-return incarnations. Kicker/offspring are added and X is zero. Mana abilities precede payment; the determined total remains fixed. This permission gives no finality counter; an independently chosen Samurai permission does."
